# Allow-list: the build context is the repository root, but the image needs only the install and serve routes.
# Everything else stays out of the context (and so out of the image), including a checkpoint downloaded into the
# clone (*.safetensors would otherwise be sent to the Docker daemon).
*
!LICENSE
!release/install-env.sh
!release/requirements-pinned.txt
!release/requirements-pip.txt
!release/requirements-container-toolkit.txt
!patches/vllm-0.30.0
!serve
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.bak*
**/*.safetensors
